{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54549","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猛将气，显赫（京本作「象」）又冲天。\n或似双蛇山岳（辛本、川本作「兵」）样，又如仓廪及浓烟，休战最爲先。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}